# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Submodules.
#
# The Entra ID pieces this template expects a deployment to carry are split
# across two mechanisms, and the split is not arbitrary:
#
#   * Authentication is CONTRIB, installed by Composer: drupal/azure_oauth_sso
#     plus drupal/externalauth. It is versioned, patchable and needs no
#     submodule. See docs/AUTHENTICATION.md.
#   * Outbound mail is a SUBMODULE, because it is a first-party module that
#     depends on Azure resources this template provisions and has no
#     drupal.org release.
#
# A submodule rather than a Composer path repository so a `git clone
# --recurse-submodules` of the deployment is complete, and so the module's own
# history stays separate from the site's.
#
# Clone with:  git clone --recurse-submodules <this repo>
# Already cloned:  git submodule update --init --recursive
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[submodule "web/modules/custom/azure_logic_app_mailer"]
	path = web/modules/custom/azure_logic_app_mailer
	url = https://github.com/pu-orfe/azure_logic_app_mailer.git
